	<string>SmartWindow needs Accessibility access to detect and manage your open windows, read window titles, and switch between them.</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SmartWindow asks Spotify and Music what is playing to show the current track in the notch.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SmartWindow shows in the notch when a Bluetooth device connects, disconnects or runs low on battery.</string>
	<key>NSFocusStatusUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SmartWindow shows in the notch when a Focus turns on or off.</string>
	<key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SmartWindow measures your microphone level while a call is on, to move the waveform in the notch. It keeps no audio and sends none.</string>
